Third-party dependencies
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project depends on the following packages. Their licences are compatible
with Apache-2.0; each remains under its own terms and copyright.

  mlx-swift                — MIT         — https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift
  mlx-swift-lm             — MIT         — https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift-lm
  swift-argument-parser    — Apache-2.0  — https://github.com/apple/swift-argument-parser
  swift-syntax             — Apache-2.0  — https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-syntax

Used by the command-line tool only, not by the library modules:

  swift-transformers       — Apache-2.0  — https://github.com/huggingface/swift-transformers
  swift-huggingface        — Apache-2.0  — https://github.com/huggingface/swift-huggingface

The Metal kernel library required by MLX under `swift test` is compiled from the
resolved mlx-swift checkout at test time and is not distributed with this
repository. See scripts/ensure-mlx-metal-library.sh.
